# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: An accepted cumulative-upkeep payment still fails when its mana cost cannot be paid.
# Forcing: Mystic Remora has no available mana source at its first upkeep.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no battlefield or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = the failed payment sacrifices Mystic Remora and play continues.
#   LOSE = Mystic Remora remains without paying its upkeep cost.
#   TIMEOUT = the upkeep interaction or sacrifice does not complete.
# Card roles:
#   Mystic Remora — supplies cumulative upkeep {1} with no legal payment source.
#   Mountain — keeps an ordinary legal action available before passing the turn.
# Protocol path: upkeep trigger, optional cost decision, failed mana payment, and sacrifice.

